# Play test of The Great Fen (CIPlay great_fen, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The mere round -10 -10 (water 28..64 m out), Sevenbridge's island inside it (r 26, 1.5 m): the hall -15.3..-4.8 x
# -15.3..-4.8, its bell tower's deck at -11 -19 (12 m up), the vault at -29..-23 x -20.3..-11.3. The villages: Reedcut -10 95,
# Eelmarsh 64 64 (its pool at 72 72, 7 m down), Mothwick 75 -10 (the pond's islet 75 6), Turfholm 64 -84 (the bog 78 -90),
# Heronsby 35 -130 (the healer's table 43 -127), Willowbend -115 -10 (the mill isle -132 -28), Stillwater -85 70 (the beast
# at -62 45.4). Each bridge's windlass ~37 m out from the middle, its town-side zone 23 m out. The landing 40 -189.
